    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if \"rediscovery\" is even possible. it feels less like being lost and more like the person who was capable of enjoying things just... ceased to exist. it's like the core of me was tied to them, and now that they're gone, there's nothing left underneath. just this hollow, empty shell that's going through the motions. it feels so pointless to even try to find something new when the \"me\" that mattered is already dead.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
